  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Scan
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a744c64617fe5a45aee818aa59f5590, type: 3}
  description: 'The <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#33CC66>scan</color>()</font>
    command detects the tile directly in front of the robot.

    The <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#33CC66>scan</color>()</font> command returns a result. This result
    is a <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#4FC3F7>str</color></font> (String) value
    describing what is currently detected.


    Examples of common usage:

    <indent=1em>-
    Store the result in a variable: <font="JetBrainsMono SDF">tile = <color=#33CC66>scan</color>()</font></indent>

    <indent=1em>-
    Print the result directly: <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#F5F5AB>print</color>(<color=#33CC66>scan</color>())</font></indent>


    Using
    <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#33CC66>scan</color>()</font> is important because
    it allows the robot to gather information about the environment before making
    any decisions.'
  isImageBig: 0
